menu "Tricorder diagnostic fixtures"
    config TRICORDER_JPEG_QUEUE_TIMEOUT_FIXTURE
        bool "Inject one JPEG queued timeout and expected panic"
        default n
        help
            Reserve the DMA2D TX reorder channel without starting DMA. The
            first real JPEG queues and times out. The ownership guard must
            panic before returning from the driver. Skip the fixture on its
            panic reboot. This is fault-injection firmware, not acceptance
            firmware; disable it before collecting normal workload evidence.
endmenu
